docs/DECISIONS.md:2581:- Step 2 on the review page (the complete retrieval entry point of D250, main branch) is verified as a component and has no production consumer until step 3 (question selection) exists; nothing of it goes to production in this decision. The paused runs (`english-v29/v30`, `english-v32`) stay paused; whether a three-month run resumes with `poc-v34` is Alex's call.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2841:- Decided: the Singapore case overview and its defendants' details are optional evidence (kept or omitted without penalty) wherever the reference or a gold marked them excluded under his question 5 (D215, gold v5 G05, standard §11's exclusion line). Whether a question may be opened from the case is still judged by the standard's §6 tests like any other matter; a court step against the defendants does not change an NVDA position, so such questions stay out. The role-v22 example "Singapore charged four firms over server exports" is no longer a conflict to fix.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2866:- For Alex: (1) the Kyber change rewrites the standard's main_driver ("承载公司价值的年度量") to include a product generation's launch or ship date; (2) the quote-check rule (typographic differences only, or also one elided run within a sentence, the stored quote restored to the source text; replay on 708 stored answers: 38 refusals to 24 or 35, no false accept read) changes what the system accepts; (3) ruled-out questions trace to the standard's own opening reasons (入股, 融资) without its 值得追 test, and two prompt wordings did not change them: a change to §6 or a code rule is his call. Nothing is adopted until the combined prompt is measured on the week and the holdout.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2871:- Decided, as proposed: (1) the standard's main driver also covers the launch or ship date of the product generation that carries the company's value; (2) the quote check accepts a quote that differs from the source only by punctuation, quotation marks or case, or by one run of words left out within one sentence, and stores the exact source text; (3) a binding obligation opens a question when the company guarantees, finances others, buys or backstops in its own name, or takes an equity stake whose size is stated and is not yet completed; its own borrowing does not open one. standard.md §6 is amended in these words.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2882:- Decided (Alex's words): no three-draw rounds and no self-built scoring ruler for this work; each article's answer is read beside its text, obvious errors are fixed in the prompt by the prompt principles (AGENTS §6, D237: general rules, examples from other industries) and tried at once with one send per article.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2883:- Done: six rounds on the 118 bench articles with gpt-6-luna, role-v24 to role-v29 (poc-v40 to poc-v45), each round read by hand and logged with its own mistakes (`docs/research/2026-10-29-analyst-standard/loop-2026-10-29/log.md`). Each rule comes from the signed standard (D229, §2 keep and reject lists, §6 opening reasons, §8 judgement 11), not from a new rule: another company's valuation, share price or deals that touch none of the company's markets, retail prices, content and compatibility details, and investors' trades are rejected even when a named party states them; a counterparty's or industry's statement that bears on demand, supply, input costs, competition, prices or products is kept; one deal, hire, programme or reported measure with its figures is one item; a reported announcement is a fact, rumour is what the item credits to unnamed sources; a guarantee or credit support for another party's debt, lease or revenue, financing to others, a purchase commitment or a backstop opens an obligation question whether or not the item gives its amount, while the company's own borrowing and leases and a completed or unsized stake do not; a launch or ship date opens only for the company's own product.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2901:## D240 · 2026-10-29 · A named party's action without an amount is kept; a reject rule never removes what the standard keeps
docs/DECISIONS.md:2922:- Decided: `docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html` (version 2.15) is the extraction step's PRD and the one source of the draft standard; its rules are those of `standard-v2.14.md`, which it supersedes, and it adds the golden set's results (§8) and how a prompt change is written, measured and iterated (§9, pointing to AGENTS.md). Its status is unchanged by this decision: a draft until Alex decides its twelve proposals; until then the signed standard (D229) is the only ruler and no prompt changes (D241). AGENTS.md §8 points to the page; §6 (writing prompts) and §7 (measuring and iterating, split into the ruler, reading results and iterating) carry the principles that were missed in earlier rounds, each with Alex's words or the incident behind it; outdated statements were removed (the design-phase "no product code" rule, a function that no longer exists, the old glossary section name). Two principles quote Alex's words from earlier the same day, recorded here as their source: on iterating, "你一类一类改，快速迭代然后测regression"; on self-graded measurement, "你的这个垃圾代码和尺子根本就是fucking cancer 我根本无法相信你的评价". The same AGENTS.md is in both worktrees. The README of each branch describes that branch. A read-only Codex review checked the rewrite against the old file and the decisions, and the page against v2.14 (`review-agents-rewrite.md`, `review-page-v2.15.md`); its confirmed findings were fixed, among them a D240 rule written stronger than Alex's words, a calibration step he never asked for, and 49 golden entries without speaker or meaning, now filled from the text.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2924:## D243 · 2026-10-29 · The extraction standard is signed: proposal 5 stricter, the other eleven at their leans; lean cautious, catch the increment
docs/DECISIONS.md:2953:## D248 · 2026-10-30 · What counts as one question and one piece of evidence: seven boundaries, chosen one by one
docs/DECISIONS.md:2970:- Alex, after a second-turn probe judged statements by standard 5.1 correctly that the one-pass answer had kept: "那为什么你不在prompt 里面要求做完自己复核一边就好，这样就是一个call完成"; then "你尝试一组先吧，这个完全就是再prompt 的最后面要求做完一遍基于"你刚才说的复核条件"再跑一次；写在同一个提示词里面"; then "可以，但是这个做法是有效的对吧，那你应该好好地写复核的侧重点然后跑；这个如果有效可以记录下来这个做法"; then the goal "你需要让这个加到prompt里面的方式improve performance. 一定要improve but don't hardcode or break our principles".
docs/DECISIONS.md:2971:- Decided (the method, written at AGENTS §6): from role-v59 the extraction request ends with a check that reads the evidence list back by standard 5.1 (`prompts/review-v<N>.txt`, `extraction.REVIEW_FROM`) and names no empty-answer condition; the role text of role-v59 to role-v63 is role-v53's. Every line of the check cites the standard (§5.1, §5.3, §6, D238, D243, D240); six read-only Codex rounds (`research/2026-10-30-noise/codex-review-*`); examples from other industries.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2975:## D250 · 2026-10-31 · Four evidence boundaries and the counting unit settled; the ruler is fixed before any further measurement (standard version 5)
docs/DECISIONS.md:2979:  1. **An arrangement retold without a new step** (Nokia AI-RAN collaboration, a carmaker's model on the platform, labs using a system): the lean as put: "只描述一个现成安排、没有新动作的，算背景，不收". An arrangement the item only describes as already in place (a collaboration, a customer using a product, a deployment), with no new step, is background and not kept, even when the item gives no date; everything else under the retelling row (D243 item 6, "看不出是旧事的不算重提") is judged as before, and guidance and a forecast or plan still in force keep their weight when retold.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2981:  3. **A comparison the company, a partner or a third party publishes** ("10x lower cost than closed models", "40% more GPUs in the same power budget", a third party's test): the lean as put: "标准只说'对手拿来和本公司比'的要按 5.1 判；其余的都算产品细节，不收". A partner's or customer's adoption or integration in the same sentence is not dropped by this rule and is judged by 5.1 as before (the lean says nothing about it; an unconditional keep would be a new rule); ruling 4 (a competitor's 2.4x, supporting) unchanged.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2982:  4. **A named analyst's view of a new event** ("a Kyber delay widens the window for alternatives"): the lean as put: "只是解读一件已经记下的事、没有新事实或推算的，不收". One that adds a new fact or calculation is judged by 5.1; the conditional valuation (5.3) is unchanged.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2984:- The ruler (Alex: "你要修正尺子"): the standard page goes to version 5 with these rules, then a read-only drift review; the gold's evidence part is re-derived for version 5 (version 4 changed no evidence entry, `gold-v4-evidence-check.md`) by two independent readers with every disagreement decided against the article, written as a new frozen file with every change listed (before, after, reason), the version-3 file untouched (D243 item 11); the opening part of the gold is not re-derived here and the scorer reports no question score until it is. The scorer refuses a gold whose evidence part was made for another version of the page: `final_scores.py` had bypassed `score_gold.py`'s version check and scored rounds since D248 on the version-3 gold, which is the false measurement Alex names.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2985:- Not decided here: the financing-analysis entries (an IRR scenario, a debt-service floor) the blind reader would keep; they are judged by 5.1 in the re-derivation like any entry not on the 5.3 list.
docs/DECISIONS.md:2992:## D252 · 2026-10-31 · The extraction prompt teaches what noise looks like, with general paired counter-examples; useful theses and evidence must not regress
docs/DECISIONS.md:2995:- Decided: the role text carries a section that teaches noise by paired examples, one pair per §5.3 row that the measurement shows the model keeps (an existing arrangement retold against a new step; management cheer against guidance; an author's view against a sourced estimate; a trend remark against a figure; a product boast against business scale; a political stance against a policy step; a general risk against a supplier's stated cut; another company's own matter against one with a path; an analyst's reading against the fact it reads). Every pair is general (no covered company, product or figure) and sits inside its row's boundary: the kept side of each pair is what the standard keeps. The acceptance order is fixed: core and supporting recall first (no regression against the control, blind-corrected), then the noise count; a version that lowers recall is not adopted whatever its noise number.

