     9	  - an arrangement retold: "two airlines fly the planemaker's jets" | a new step: "a third airline ordered 40 of the jets for 2028 delivery";
    10	  - management cheer: "the CEO called the quarter spectacular and the pipeline the strongest ever" | guidance: "the CEO said full-year revenue will be $12–13 billion";
    11	  - an author's or analyst's view: "the stock looks cheap"; "this is a buying opportunity" | a sourced estimate: "an analyst valued the shares at $80, 15 times next year's earnings of $5.30";
